      <title>iG五局鏖战淘汰TES，Jiaqi起势暴露滔博下路双补助崩盘</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/iG%E4%BA%94%E5%B1%80%E9%8F%96%E6%88%98%E6%B7%98%E6%B1%B0TESJiaqi%E8%B5%B7%E5%8A%BF%E6%9A%B4%E9%9C%B2%E6%BB%94%E5%8D%9A%E4%B8%8B%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%8C%E8%A1%A5%E5%8A%A9%E5%B4%A9%E7%9B%98/</link>
